# CMDEDIT-SEL-01: metal1 0 0 20 20; select area metal1 under a smaller box; select less area.
# Hefesto script (hefesto-cli --diagnostics=magic): the same commands.
tech load input/tiny -noprompt
load a
box 0 0 20 20
paint metal1
box 5 5 10 10
select area metal1
what -list
select bbox
select clear
box 0 0 20 20
select area metal1
box 5 5 10 10
select less area metal1
what -list
select bbox
